      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I suspect this is the same issue that also killed bhaptics/VRChatOSC?\n\nThe program only says \"Searching for VRChat Client...\" but the actual log reads similar:\n\n2025-09-16 21:56:45.388 EROR bHapticsOSC.Query.OscQueryService+<TryGetOscTree>d__18.MoveNext(): TryGetOscTree Failed to check OSC status: Unexpected end when reading token. Path 'ÎÎÌÌÌÏÏÎÍÌÌÌÌÌÎÌÌÌÎÏÌÌÍ'.\n\n2025-09-16 21:56:46.391 EROR bHapticsOSC.Query.OscQueryService+<TryGetOscTree>d__18.MoveNext(): TryGetOscTree Failed to check OSC status: Unexpected end when reading token. Path 'ÎÎÌÌÌÏÏÎÍÌÌÌÌÌÎÌÌÌÎÏÌÌÍ'.\n\n2025-09-16 21:56:47.420 EROR bHapticsOSC.Query.OscQueryService+<TryGetOscTree>d__18.MoveNext(): TryGetOscTree Failed to check OSC status: Unterminated string. Expected delimiter: \". Path 'CONTENTS.chatbox.CONTENTS.typing.FULL_PATH', line 1, position 14349.\n\n2025-09-16 21:56:48.432 EROR bHapticsOSC.Query.OscQueryService+<TryGetOscTree>d__18.MoveNext(): TryGetOscTree Failed to check OSC status: Unterminated string. Expected delimiter: \". Path 'CONTENTS.chatbox.CONTENTS.typing.FULL_PATH', line 1, position 14349.",
